WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.970
In 2006, two years before the Marvel Cinematic
Universe turned superheroes into the biggest

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:12.640
thing in Hollywood, Tim Kring and future Marvel
TV guru Jeph Loeb ntroduced the world to Heroes.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:18.630
A high concept science fiction series built
around a modern superhero mythology, Heroes

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:25.150
ran for four wildly uneven seasons before
returning in 2015 with the 13-episode epilogue

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.060
Heroes: Reborn.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:31.100
So what else has the cast of Heroes been up
to since the series ended?

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.760
And how has time treated your favorite stars?

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:37.360
Here's a look at what the cast of Heroes looks
like today.

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:39.390
Milo Ventimiglia

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:44.620
Prior to his breakout role as Peter Petrelli
on Heroes, Milo Ventimiglia was known as the

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:48.120
irascible and romantic Jess on Gilmore Girls.

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:53.750
Through every action-packed moment on Heroes,
Ventimiglia never failed to find the aching

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:58.899
humanity in his character, and was often the
heart that held the series together.

00:00:58.899 --> 00:01:03.500
These days, Ventimiglia is still providing
the heart and soul on a major TV smash hit

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:07.850
as Jack Pearson in the beloved NBC drama This
Is Us.

00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:13.229
From Gilmore Girls to Heroes to This Is Us,
Ventimiglia is already a TV legend - and he's

00:01:13.229 --> 00:01:14.930
only in his 40s!

00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:16.700
Keep on rocking, Milo!

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.709
Hayden Panettiere

00:01:18.709 --> 00:01:23.679
The catchphrase "Save the cheerleader, save
the world" helped turn Heroes into a hit - and

00:01:23.679 --> 00:01:28.100
Hayden Panettiere into one of the hottest
new stars in Hollywood.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:32.190
As cheerleader Claire Bennet, Panettiere was
at the center of the series right from the

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:33.609
show's opening moment.

00:01:33.609 --> 00:01:38.729
Though Panettiere didn't appear in Heroes:
Reborn, she's still been plenty busy over

00:01:38.729 --> 00:01:39.920
the past decade.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:44.630
Besides having a daughter with her partner,
heavyweight champion Wladimir Klitschko, she's

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:49.060
also appeared in films like I Love You, Beth
Cooper and Scream 4.

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:54.409
But she's best known these days for her starring
role as Juliette Barnes on Nashville, which

00:01:54.409 --> 00:01:59.369
earned her two Golden Globe nominations over
the show's six hit seasons.

00:01:59.369 --> 00:02:01.310
Zachary Quinto

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:06.490
Brain-collecting psychopath Sylar was the
terror at the rotten core of Heroes, hunting

00:02:06.490 --> 00:02:11.150
down and killing some of our favorite characters
- not to mention his own mom.

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:16.830
But there was a plus side, as Sylar also introduced
the world to the talents of Zachary Quinto.

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:22.060
Since then, Quinto has become a power behind
the scenes as well as in front of the camera,

00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:27.530
producing films like Margin Call and TV shows
such as The Chair while helping relaunch Star

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:31.160
Trek for a new generation as the iconic Mister
Spock.

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:38.820
"Khaaaaan!"

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:42.560
Masi Oka

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:48.370
Prior to taking on the role of time traveling
salaryman Hiro Nakamura, Masi Oka was best

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:50.790
known for a small role on Scrubs.

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:56.660
But as Heroes' breakout fan favorite Hiro,
Oka rocketed to fame, earning a Golden Globe

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:57.660
nomination in the process.

00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:59.870
And he hasn't slowed down, either.

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:05.100
Besides making a cameo in Heroes: Reborn,
Oka earned a legion of new fans thanks to

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:08.260
his seven year run as fan-favorite Max on
Hawaii Five-Oh.

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:10.960
We can't wait to see what he's going to do
next.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:16.280
"Yatta!"

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:19.320
Greg Grunberg

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:25.810
Fans of J.J. Abrams' series Felicity and Alias
would be quick to tell you all about the heartfelt,

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:31.350
common man sincerity of actor Greg Grunberg,
who played telepathic detective Matt Parkman

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:36.560
on Heroes - and shockingly turned to the dark
side as a bad guy in Heroes: Reborn.

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:41.750
Outside of Heroes, Grunberg has been keeping
active by appearing in pretty much every project

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:47.350
Abrams has ever done, most notably as pilot
Snap Wexley in Star Wars: The Force Awakens.

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:53.430
And in 2014, he completed a multi-episode
stint on Showtime's hit series Masters of

00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:54.430
Sex.

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:57.690
We're still waiting for Grunberg to get the
leading man role he deserves, but we get it

00:03:57.690 --> 00:04:02.390
- playing J.J's personal mascot has to take
up a lot of his time.

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:04.010
Jack Coleman

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:08.819
His name is Jack Coleman, but to Heroes fans,
he'll always be the man in the horn rimmed

00:04:08.819 --> 00:04:13.160
glasses, aka HRG, or Noah Bennet if you're
being really formal.

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:18.790
A morally gray agent who specializes in hunting
down people with powers, Noah's motives are

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:22.949
always kept close to the vest except when
his daughter Claire is involved, in which

00:04:22.949 --> 00:04:27.210
case HRG always makes it clear that family
comes first.

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:31.590
Beyond Heroes, Coleman has spent the last
decade appearing in numerous guest roles on

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:34.180
TV shows from The Office to Castle.

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:38.370
We're not sure where he's going to turn up
next, but one thing is certain: you haven't

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:41.569
seen the last of Jack Coleman just yet.

00:04:41.569 --> 00:04:43.210
Ali Larter

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:48.069
She broke into Hollywood with a bang thanks
to her now iconic whipped cream bikini scene

00:04:48.069 --> 00:04:52.770
in Varsity Blues, and scored raves opposite
Reese Witherspoon in Legally Blonde.

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:58.009
But Ali Larter's career never quite took off
the way fans expected, with the notable exception

00:04:58.009 --> 00:05:03.349
of her star turn as Niki Sanders - and Niki's
various doppelgangers and split personalities

00:05:03.349 --> 00:05:04.909
- on Heroes.

00:05:04.909 --> 00:05:09.210
Since Heroes went off the air, Larter has
starred in TV shows such as Legends, and has

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:13.319
gained a new generation of fans thanks to
the Resident Evil franchise.

00:05:13.319 --> 00:05:16.180
Now that's the real cherry on top.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:17.969
Sendhil Ramamurthy

00:05:17.969 --> 00:05:23.240
Genetics professor Mohinder Suresh is one
of the characters that kept Heroes functioning,

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:27.979
narrating the action while also providing
all the pseudo-scientific exposition necessary.

00:05:27.979 --> 00:05:29.250
"And what now?"

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:33.490
"We wait a few seconds and see if the enzymes
attach to the cortisol."

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:36.999
So what has star Sendhil Ramamurthy been up
to recently?

00:05:36.999 --> 00:05:42.279
Besides reprising his role as Dr. Suresh in
Heroes: Reborn, Ramamurthy has also had major

00:05:42.279 --> 00:05:45.469
roles in shows such as Covert Affairs and
Reverie.

00:05:45.469 --> 00:05:50.289
And from the looks of it, his real super power
is apparently never aging.

00:05:50.289 --> 00:05:51.289
Thanks for watching!

00:05:51.289 --> 00:05:54.550
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:57.019
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

